# build-pfmm-airgap workspace + bundle output. The glob matters: PFMM_OUT is routinely
# overridden per architecture (build/.pfmm-airgap-aarch64, -x86_64), and those variants
# were not ignored -- 31k untracked files and ~8 GB of grafana build output sitting one
# `git add -A` away from the index.
build/.pfmm-airgap*/
